   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Number of recovery programmes/plans for settlements and/or territories developed
2.Number of public officials of the targeted regional and local authorities trained in recovery project formulation and implementation
3. Percentage of trained beneficiaries applying acquired knowledge and skills in practice (total, men/women)
4. Number of new initiatives prepared for launch
5.Number of initiatives supported at regional level aimed at streamlining and digitalizing the provisioning of services in wide demand among conflict affected populations
6.Number of supported local initiatives for improved access to services and income generating opportunities for displaced and local conflict-affected populations
7.Number of staff (disaggregated by sex) trained to provide public services to  population, including war-affected groups 
8. Number of people who benefitted from the supported income generating initiatives (disaggregated by sex, disability, IDP status)
9.Number of territorial government-CSO crisis coordination platforms that are active
10.Number of micro-initiatives implemented with support of Community Volunteers
11.Number of people covered by communication and awareness raising campaigns (disaggregated by sex)
12.Number of good practices identified and promoted through the inter-regional crisis response and socio-economic recovery forums
13.Number of gender-responsive crisis response and recovery assessments conducted 
14.Number of local communities targeted by capacity development on impact- and needs assessment</narrative>
    </description>
